      <div type="article" xml:id="PressMint-GB_1895-06-01_WidnesExaminer_art0117" n="art0117">
        <head>"What Cheer, China!</head>
        <p>"What Cheer, China!</p>
        <p>What will be the outcome of the War ? Four- hundred-millions of Chinese will no longer brook bonds, which have bound them for a thousand years and prevented their shaking hands with the other three-quarters of the human race. The British People will be busier, and will sell more manufactured material to the brown and yellow Peoples of the East, who will partly pay for it in Brooke, Bonds Tea. Thus our tea is valued as much as money on both sides of the world and that proves how popular it is. This better trade, like Brooke, Bonds' Tea, will revive and chear the toiling millions in our manu- facturing towns. For only fourpence, you can get this cup, that cheers, filled about forty times, by asking anyone of our thousands of Agents for quarter-pound packet of</p>
        <p>OUR Is. 4d. TEA.</p>
